1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Bro. Stop scrolling for a second.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Because what I'm about to show you —

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:09,500
is going to completely ruin
every other TV you've ever owned.

4
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:13,000
This… is the TCL C7L.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Now I know what you're thinking —
"it's just another QLED."

6
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:20,500
No. No no no.

7
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:25,000
This has SQD —
Sub-pixel Quantum Dot technology.

8
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Which means every single pixel —
red, green, blue —

9
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:31,500
has its own quantum dot filter.

10
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:35,500
Not the whole panel.
Every. Single. Pixel.

11
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:40,500
Most TVs show you color.
The C7L lets you FEEL it.

12
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:45,500
We're talking 1.07 BILLION
color combinations.

13
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:49,500
A 144Hz refresh rate —
zero blur, zero ghosting.

14
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:54,000
Over 1,000 local dimming zones
with Mini LED backlight.

15
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:57,000
Dolby Vision. HDR10+. Both.

16
00:00:57,500 --> 00:01:00,000
Yeah. They went all in.

17
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:04,500
And look — specs on paper
are one thing.

18
00:01:04,500 --> 00:01:07,000
But stand in front of this screen?

19
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:11,000
The blacks are deep.
The colors are alive.

20
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:14,500
Sports, movies, gaming —
everything hits different.

21
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:19,000
This is what your living room
has been waiting for.

22
00:01:20,500 --> 00:01:25,000
The TCL C7L.
SQD technology. Mini LED. 144Hz.

23
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:29,000
Available now at eXtra, LULU,
Jarir, and Xcite.

24
00:01:29,200 --> 00:01:33,000
Go see it in store —
ask your TCL promoter.

25
00:01:33,800 --> 00:01:37,500
Trust me.
You'll know the second you see it.
